# People the app should never import or show, one full name per line. The People
# page's Hidden contacts list writes this same file, one name at a time; copying
# this file is for adding many at once. Copy it to exclude_list.txt in the app's
# data folder: data/ when you run it from the source code, or
# ~/Library/Application Support/NetworkCRM/data for the Mac app. Imports read it
# each time they run. Lines starting with # are ignored. exclude_list.txt is
# ignored by git, so these names stay private.
#
# Example:
# Jane Doe
# John Smith
